# Lending Loan Application
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Lending — a loan request approved by someone other than the Borrower (WRP-5, reused)
# Case 14 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: lending-loan.menata

Loan Application

Fields

- Borrower : User
- Requested Amount : Money
- Term Months : Number
- Interest Rate : Number
- Status : Submitted | Approved | Rejected
- Approved By : User

Events

When Approve

    Approved By Current User

    Approved By must not equal Borrower

    Create Loan

    Status Approved

When Reject

    Status Rejected

Constraints

- Borrower is required.
- Requested Amount is required.
- Term Months is required.
- Interest Rate is required.

Permissions

Loan Officer

- Approve
- Reject

Views

- Application Form : Form
- Pending Applications : List
- Application Detail : Detail
